  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3718",
    "va": "0x10007718",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "_Try not to accelerate too hard:"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x375c",
    "va": "0x1000775c",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "you will not lose much time,"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3798",
    "va": "0x10007798",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "and you will save a lot of fuel!HDrive at a steady speed,"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x380e",
    "va": "0x1000780e",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "avoiding unnecessary acceleration and braking.eKeep the same acceleration when going uphill,"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x38ca",
    "va": "0x100078ca",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "and release the accelerator completely going downhill.GCongratulations!"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x395c",
    "va": "0x1000795c",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "Your accelerating and driving speeds are very steady.JChange up gears sooner."
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x39fa",
    "va": "0x100079fa",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "The gear change indicator can help you with this.SDo not stay too long in 1st or 2nd gear,"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3ab2",
    "va": "0x10007ab2",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "use the higher gears as soon as possible."
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3b06",
    "va": "0x10007b06",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "In town,you can use 5th gear as soon as you are at a constant speed. If you have a 6-speeds transmission,out of town change to 6th gear from 40 mph.QSometimes gear changes like"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3c6a",
    "va": "0x10007c6a",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "3rd to 5th or 4th to 2nd can be more fuel efficient.7Congratulations!"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3cf8",
    "va": "0x10007cf8",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "Your gear changing is very efficient!~Take your foot off the accelerator,you will be driving for free as the engine will cut off fuel injection when engine braking.mAnticipate other vehicles' movements:"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3e90",
    "va": "0x10007e90",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "release the accelerator as soon as you notice"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3eee",
    "va": "0x10007eee",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "there is traffic ahead."
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x3f1e",
    "va": "0x10007f1e",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "Red light in 300 yards:take your foot off the accelerator to allow time for it to change to green and for the other cars to pull away."
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x4030",
    "va": "0x10008030",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "_Green light in 300 yards:"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x4068",
    "va": "0x10008068",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "take your foot off the accelerator to anticipate it changing to red.ECongratulations!"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x4116",
    "va": "0x10008116",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "You are taking full advantage of your cars inertia.}Do not leave the engine idling, even in winter:it is cheaper and less polluting to drive off as soon as you start the engine.ZCheck the pressure every 3 months,"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x42c2",
    "va": "0x100082c2",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "preferably keeping them at the eco or motorway levels.iRemove the roof rack and roof box when not in use:"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x4398",
    "va": "0x10008398",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "they slow down the car and increase fuel consumption.ZDo not leave unnecessary objects in the vehicle:"
  },
  {
    "file_offset": "0x4468",
    "va": "0x10008468",
    "encoding": "utf16le",
    "text": "extra weight increases fuel consumption.PIn summer, use the air conditioning on motorways,"
  },
